// Layer_Model_Serving — model serving section of the Model Lifecycle Layer (layer 5)
// Manual render: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Create a NEW canvas named "Layer_Model_Serving".
// Export the PNG to materials/reports/figures/Layer_Model_Serving.png
// Icons: product logos from docs.eraser.io/docs/icons (checked 2026-07-11):
//   minio, argo, qdrant; Valkey keeps a generic icon (not the Redis logo, a
//   different fork brand). Inference request-response uses <> (factually two-way);
//   Knative scales KServe revisions (control direction from Knative).
// Reference: subsec:lapisan-model (Section IV.3, sec:arsitektur-terintegrasi);
//   second figure for the layer on row 5 of tab:layanan_industri (model serving part),
//   detailing the same layer in Figure fig:integrate-service (Section IV.1).
//   Included in LaTeX as fig:layer-serving.
// Focus: MLflow artifacts (MinIO) > KServe InferenceService on top of Knative; Argo
//   Rollouts runs canary analysis; the inference bridge reads online features
//   (Valkey) and vector features (Qdrant) to complete the predictor input; the
//   prediction consumer is the downstream boundary.
// Rendering MUST be horizontal (direction right): left-to-right chain, at most two
//   node rows per group, so the diagram spreads wide and fits the band
//   height=0.42\textheight. Included without \rotatebox in LaTeX.
// Layer grounding: the group label carries its source category (najafabadi2024analysis),
//   namely inference.
// Implementation check: nodes exist under platform/components/model-serving/kserve,
//   common/knative, gitops/argo-rollouts, storage/valkey, storage/qdrant,
//   storage/minio. Inference bridge = KServe InferenceService transformer.

direction right

// Model artifacts (boundary)
MinIO [icon: minio, color: green, label: "MinIO (MLflow artifacts)"]

// Model Serving in the Model Lifecycle Layer
Model Serving [icon: send, color: red, label: "Model serving section of the Model Lifecycle Layer (inference)"] {
  KServe [icon: server, label: "KServe (InferenceService)"]
  Knative [icon: cloud, label: "Knative (serverless)"]
  Argo Rollouts [icon: argo, label: "Argo Rollouts (canary analysis)"]
  Inference Bridge [icon: git-merge, label: "Inference Bridge (feature join)"]
}

// Online feature sources and consumer (boundary)
Valkey [icon: zap, color: green, label: "Valkey (online store)"]
Qdrant [icon: qdrant, color: green, label: "Qdrant (vector index)"]
Prediction Consumer [icon: monitor, color: gray, label: "Prediction Consumer (downstream applications)"]

// Model load and scaling flow
MinIO > KServe: load model artifact
Knative > KServe: serverless revision scaling
Argo Rollouts > KServe: progressive canary promotion

// Feature-to-predictor flow
Valkey > Inference Bridge: online features
Qdrant > Inference Bridge: vector features
Inference Bridge > KServe: features to predictor

// Inference request and response (two-way)
Prediction Consumer <> KServe: inference request and response
